NEW CONSTRUCTION OF 3 STORY MULTI UNIT BUILDING. INTERIOR INSTALLATION OF DRAINAGE, WASTE, VENT, AND WATER SUPPLY FOR LISTED FIXTURES. ALL MATERIALS SHALL BE METALLIC TO ROOF EXTENSION FOR FIXTURES AND PIPING SERVING COMMERCIAL SPACE.. VENTING TO BE DESIGNED AND INSTALLED IN ACCORDANCE WITH SECTION 919 PHILADELPHIA SINGLE STACK VENT SYSTEM. ALL WORK TO BE INSTALLED IN STRICT COMPLIANCE WITH 2018 PPC AND APPROVED PLANS

Install 44- water closets; 46-lavatories; 44- tub/shower; 45- floor drains; 
40 kitchen sinks; 40- laundry; 40- hot water heaters; 11- hose bibs; 
1- mop receptor(other); 10-roof drains1- sump pump; 
1- booster pump(other) and to include all necessary piping as per plans

